; TLS series 2 (fresh boot). Part A: 3 repeats of the sequence that failed
; once on 2026-10-08 (0.4.0 self-update, then the arospkg package upgraded
; 0.4.0 -> 0.4.1 right after). Part B: 100 installs of arospkg 0.4.1 from its
; GitHub release. Guest time around every network step, exit codes, full
; --verbose output, and a marker to the host after each step.
FAILAT 1000
Delete RAM:tls2.log QUIET
Copy PAYLOAD:IDXOLD RAM:idxold.json
Copy PAYLOAD:IDXPUB RAM:idxpub.json
Copy PAYLOAD:PUTFILE RAM:putfile
Protect RAM:putfile +e
Echo >RAM:m "tls2 start"
RAM:putfile RAM:m tls2-1008c-000-start 8765 >>RAM:tls2.log
Delete RAM:o ALL FORCE QUIET
